{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16107550","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16107550","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1610755001:1":{"text":"What happened, Professor?","source_cn":"费尔南多老师，发生了什么事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x039C5E005449BBDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1610755002:0":{"text":"Another failure! My portable modular alchemy array is a pile of scrap!","source_cn":"又失败了！我对模块化炼金魔法阵的便携式改进实验又失败了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA83A34CB8A39A198","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610755003:1":{"text":"The lab exploded! My entire custom set of alchemy equipment, all gone!","source_cn":"实验室爆炸，我定制的一整套炼金器皿都被毁掉了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA051588A51BE61F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610755004:1":{"text":"Do you have any idea how much gold I've literally burned through? Magic burns money! And alchemy explodes it! I'm filing for the triple research funding!","source_cn":"魔法就是烧钱，尤其是炼金魔法！它会爆炸，知道吗？爆炸！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA86FD7AE86D53372","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610755005:0":{"text":"There was an explosion? Are you okay?","source_cn":"试验室爆炸了？费尔南多老师，您没事吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DE29243DFD42AD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610755006:0":{"text":"Me? I'm perfectly fine! It's not like I'm mourning 740 grams of dragonblood powder, 517 grams of glitterdust, and 625 grams of elderwood pith! Not at all!","source_cn":"我？我能有什么事！我才没有对爆炸中毁掉的740克龙血石...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7C94F2ECD38503F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1610755006":{"text":"Me? I'm perfectly fine! It's not like I'm mourning 740 grams of dragonblood powder, 517 grams of glitterdust, and 625 grams of elderwood pith! Not at all!","source_cn":"我？我能有什么事！我才没有对爆炸中毁掉的740克龙血石粉末、517克闪光粉尘和625克精灵树芯心痛，我一切都很好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7C94F2ECD38503F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610755007:1":{"text":"Hmph! I said I'm fine, so I'm fine! Failures like this happen all the time in alchemy!","source_cn":"哼！我说没有就是没有，要你多嘴……炼金实验出问题是非常...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBB409FA0CFD8ABF5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hmph! I said I'm fine, so I'm fine! Failures like this happen all the time in alchemy!","female":"Hmph! I said I'm fine, so I'm fine! Failures like this happen all the time in alchemy!","variant_male_record_index":"200080","variant_female_record_index":"200081","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610755009:0":{"text":"The important thing is that no one was hurt because my protection spells held! And, ha! My personal stash of <style=\"highlight\">firevein ore</style> is perfectly safe!","source_cn":"当然啦，多亏了我的保护魔法，没有任何人受伤，我花了很大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D0F13A8FC1D7790","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1610755009":{"text":"The important thing is that no one was hurt because my protection spells held! And, ha! My personal stash of <style=\"highlight\">firevein ore</style> is perfectly safe!","source_cn":"当然啦，多亏了我的保护魔法，没有任何人受伤，我花了很大力气才托人买到的<style=highlight>金色火纹铁矿</style>也一点损失都没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D0F13A8FC1D7790","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1610755011:1":{"text":"Professor, could you please sell me some?","source_cn":"费尔南多老师，能卖一些金色火纹铁矿给我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA8BB08489A275F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1610755012:1":{"text":"Ah, so that's why you've graced me with your presence. You need something.","source_cn":"休，你有一段时间没来了，我就说你怎么今天突然出现，原来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x898A4CA8F39E1A99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1610755013:1":{"text":"Sorry, Professor. I've been swamped with the selection exam...","source_cn":"真是抱歉，费尔南多老师，我前阵子在准备宫廷魔法师选拔赛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89DAAC08C88BE014","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1610755014:1":{"text":"Yes, yes, save it. I remember all the help you gave in the lab. So what do you need it for?","source_cn":"好了好了，不用解释，你在炼金实验室做了这么久志愿者，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47A457561AB9DA9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1610755015:1":{"text":"It's for my family sword. It was damaged.","source_cn":"我的佩剑受了些损伤，我需要金色火纹铁矿来修复佩剑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7CE4B10803E1FAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1610755016:1":{"text":"That heirloom of yours? I can't believe you let that happen...","source_cn":"哦，是你那把宝贝得不行的传家宝啊，啧，你居然会让它受损……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1FE899C08E16E0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1610755017:1":{"text":"Fine. How much do you need?","source_cn":"说吧，你要多少金色火纹铁矿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3FC1F6A65265960","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1610755017":{"text":"Fine. How much do you need?","source_cn":"说吧，你要多少金色火纹铁矿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3FC1F6A65265960","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1610755018:1":{"text":"Hmm... For a blade that size, that's about right.","source_cn":"……嗯，那把剑尺寸不算长，确实应该够了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD245E5A3CE83B398","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hmm... For a blade that size, that's about right.","female":"Hmm... For a blade that size, that's about right.","variant_male_record_index":"200093","variant_female_record_index":"200094","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1610755020:1":{"text":"Alright, alright. I can spare that much. I won't even charge you. Here.","source_cn":"行了，300克而已，我也不收你的钱了。休，拿去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16AFF399859E1ACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:20::2":{"text":"","source_cn":"","status":"matched_item_resource","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1610755021:1":{"text":"This is too generous...","source_cn":"这……<key:dialog62>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71F72C7C4105F844","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1610755022:1":{"text":"Aren't you in a hurry to fix that sword? Consider it your... advanced alchemy assignment. Now take your \"course materials\" and go.","source_cn":"你不是急着修复你的佩剑吗？这是……对，这是我给你布置的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECA951C3FBF37029","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1610755023:1":{"text":"Thank you, Professor...","source_cn":"谢谢您，费尔南多老师……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81177EEFF9FBD140","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1610755024:1":{"text":"Oh, don't look at me like that. Off with you both! Shoo! Some of us have funding requests to exaggerate.","source_cn":"好了好了，别摆出一副想哭的表情，一点都不适合你。赶紧去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80FABDFA4F78FAF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1610755025:1":{"text":"And if you botch the enchanting and lose an eyebrow, you know where to find me.","source_cn":"如果有什么炼金上的问题，你可以随时来找我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C74F808243445FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:0:1":{"text":"About 300 grams should do.","source_cn":"300克就足够了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA6C5E18270CA2512","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"About 300 grams should do.","female":"About 300 grams should do.","variant_male_record_index":"82107","variant_female_record_index":"82108","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1610755019:1":{"text":"Excuse me?! The audacity!","source_cn":"咳，年轻人，你还真敢得寸进尺！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x21DBF4C8D6C61307","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Excuse me?! The audacity!","female":"Excuse me?! The audacity!","variant_male_record_index":"200095","variant_female_record_index":"200096","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1610755019":{"text":"Excuse me?! The audacity!","source_cn":"咳，年轻人，你还真敢得寸进尺！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x21DBF4C8D6C61307","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Excuse me?! The audacity!","female":"Excuse me?! The audacity!","variant_male_record_index":"200095","variant_female_record_index":"200096","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:0:1":{"text":"I'm kidding! Just 300 grams.","source_cn":"开玩笑的，只需要300克","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9E481DF6F07B49EF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm kidding! Just 300 grams.","female":"I'm kidding! Just 300 grams.","variant_male_record_index":"82111","variant_female_record_index":"82112","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:1:2":{"text":"Why not give us all of it?","source_cn":"要不全给我们……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDDEAB94E2D070865","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Why not give us all of it?","female":"Why not give us all of it?","variant_male_record_index":"82109","variant_female_record_index":"82110","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"You have firevein ore?!","source_cn":"您有金色火纹铁矿！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6985613E63B6F989","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You have firevein ore?!","female":"You have firevein ore?!","variant_male_record_index":"82103","variant_female_record_index":"82104","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1610755010:1":{"text":"Wait, professor! You have firevein ore?!","source_cn":"金色火纹铁矿？！您真的有金色火纹铁矿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8F293B781FB182F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"No damage? That's great!","source_cn":"没有损失？太好了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x172C1566FB52287C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"No damage? That's great!","female":"No damage? That's great!","variant_male_record_index":"82105","variant_female_record_index":"82106","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"You don't sound fine...","source_cn":"克数都记得很清楚，真的没心痛？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x33D3E7586D4AA755","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You don't sound fine...","female":"You don't sound fine...","variant_male_record_index":"82099","variant_female_record_index":"82100","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1610755008:1":{"text":"Bah! You youngsters don't understand. This is normal!","source_cn":"哼，你们这些年轻人懂什么！炼金实验出问题是非常常见的事情！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x689F65FDBC479001","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Bah! You youngsters don't understand. This is normal!","female":"Bah! You youngsters don't understand. This is normal!","variant_male_record_index":"200082","variant_female_record_index":"200083","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"The lab looks rough...","source_cn":"看来实验室损毁严重","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDE1618A2E0E8EF29","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The lab looks rough...","female":"The lab looks rough...","variant_male_record_index":"82101","variant_female_record_index":"82102","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:休":{"text":"Silven","source":"休","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:费尔南多":{"text":"Fernando","source":"费尔南多","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":38,"localized_text_count":37,"speaker_count":2}}